The December 2026 meeting of LRUG will be on *Monday the 14th of December*,
from _6:00pm_ to _8:00pm_ (meeting starts at _6:30pm_).

This month we're hosted by our friends at [Carwow](https://www.carwow.co.uk/jobs)
in [their offices][carwow-venue], next to Victoria station and around the
corner from Buckingham Palace. [Full venue and registration details are given
below](#dec26registration).

